        "answer": {
          "short": "$5a-1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_5(6.4)&=\\log_5(32/5)\\\\\\log_5(6.4)&=\\log_5(2^5)-\\log_5(5)\\\\\\log_5(6.4)&=5\\log_5(2)-1\\\\\\log_5(6.4)&=5a-1\\end{align*}$$",
